  "2026-11-07T13:53:00.446Z",codex-agent,"Class search: contract-specific gap creation exists only in auditChangelogClaims; renderer/JSON/summary decisions used a generator-local presentation helper. Move that unchanged eligibility policy to contract-changes and reuse it everywhere, including shared entry-title resolution and audit, instead of duplicating neutral-closure conditionals or inspecting prose/headings. Contributors already skip item evidence checks; dependencies/empty claims have no item declarations. The new adversarial publication oracle failed on the incoming raw-reader audit and passes after the fix across 5760 combinations, including direct/nested/null-fallback malformed metadata, all issue-like types, repair evidence, custom status aliases, frozen selections and all groupings. Hidden declarations produce exactly the same report as removing their metadata; required ordinary evidence gaps remain. Eligible declarations still report missing migration/before/after. Extend packed Node/Bun SDK/CLI/host JSON/TOON acceptance with an incomplete neutral issue; do not weaken existing assertions."
