  "2026-11-09T16:30:16.823Z","harness:claude-code","Orchestrator fix for the CI failure of 'packed contract projections run without Bun installed' on test (22): the Bun-free PATH held only node and npm, and Node 22's bundled npm spawns sh (spawn sh ENOENT). The test now links a POSIX sh into that PATH too (not on Windows). Reproduced locally with Node 22.23.4: the original fails with spawn sh ENOENT, the fix passes; Node 24 passes either way."
